00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:41.630
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:58.110
In today's story, Skeletor was looking for a shortcut, a quick way to riches and power.

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:00.000
