00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.200
always looking for the quick way

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.580
to get ahead of everybody else.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.300
Well, it doesn't work that way.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:06.860
The people who succeed

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:08.800
